{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A management survival game with a deep narrative and moral choices, where you run a hospital in a war zone.</strong> Scarce resources force you to decide who you will save: children, those with the best chance of survival, or the journalist who could expose the truth. The story reflects real-world war conflicts, seen through the eyes of a medical team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While struggling to keep your war-torn hospital alive, you\u2019ll face branching narrative arcs with multiple endings, each shaped by difficult moral dilemmas. Inspired by real events, every decision will challenge not only your ability to survive, but your own humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/7e50a498d96d2225c98a3ba2152daa14.poster.avif?t=1770710269\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/7e50a498d96d2225c98a3ba2152daa14.webm?t=1770710269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/7e50a498d96d2225c98a3ba2152daa14.mp4?t=1770710269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >War Angels \u2013 Main Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be Resourceful</strong><br>Craft medicine, improvise tools, and keep the hospital running with whatever you can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treat Under Siege</strong><br>Decide who to treat first as soldiers and bombs press closer to your hospital walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They Are Human</strong><br>Doctors, volunteers, and patients suffer from hunger, fear, and despair. Keep morale alive as war slowly breaks them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Good Decisions</strong><br>Every choice has consequences: save a child or a journalist? Extract organs from the dying to save the living? Amputate or let them go? The answers are never easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Ruins</strong><br>Send survivors outside the hospital to scavenge for scarce resources\u2014at great risk of never returning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>War Changes People</strong><br>Your decisions will shape not only survival, but who your people become in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3312350?t=1770710269","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/a9de0185035fc501ff45c068a87943d0d07195a3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770710269","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/3828457a6b02b797702ddeb03a03d49f3e38b1da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770710269","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/3828457a6b02b797702ddeb03a03d49f3e38b1da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770710269","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A management survival game with a deep narrative and moral choices, where you run a hospital in a war zone.</strong> Scarce resources force you to decide who you will save: children, those with the best chance of survival, or the journalist who could expose the truth. The story reflects real-world war conflicts, seen through the eyes of a medical team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While struggling to keep your war-torn hospital alive, you\u2019ll face branching narrative arcs with multiple endings, each shaped by difficult moral dilemmas. Inspired by real events, every decision will challenge not only your ability to survive, but your own humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/7e50a498d96d2225c98a3ba2152daa14.poster.avif?t=1770710269\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/7e50a498d96d2225c98a3ba2152daa14.webm?t=1770710269\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/extras/7e50a498d96d2225c98a3ba2152daa14.mp4?t=1770710269\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >War Angels \u2013 Main Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be Resourceful</strong><br>Craft medicine, improvise tools, and keep the hospital running with whatever you can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Treat Under Siege</strong><br>Decide who to treat first as soldiers and bombs press closer to your hospital walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They Are Human</strong><br>Doctors, volunteers, and patients suffer from hunger, fear, and despair. Keep morale alive as war slowly breaks them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Good Decisions</strong><br>Every choice has consequences: save a child or a journalist? Extract organs from the dying to save the living? Amputate or let them go? The answers are never easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the Ruins</strong><br>Send survivors outside the hospital to scavenge for scarce resources\u2014at great risk of never returning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>War Changes People</strong><br>Your decisions will shape not only survival, but who your people become in the process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Leolit Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3312350/edd9310cd66fe42f97e95771f732879eeef386c1/header.jpg?t=1770710269","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3312350/238667362/cb5363b878d8ac6116024565f70aca47210e6d5d/1755665001/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755675431","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3312350/238667362/cb5363b878d8ac6116024565f70aca47210e6d5d/1755665001/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755675431","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3312350/238667362/cb5363b878d8ac6116024565f70aca47210e6d5d/1755665001/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755675431","id":257093103,"name":"War Angels Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257093103/a155d3a88c2fb1ae4b74f7a1a5cb540a4a4ae839/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755675431"}],"name":"War Angels","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti or AMD R7 360<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 Ti / GTX 1650 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":t